---
import PrimaryButton from "../components/PrimaryButton.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Freeze-to-Command Scorecard — Cyrus";
const description =
  "A short private assessment to help you identify where pressure may be costing you emotional command.";
const assessmentPath = "/scorecard/assessment";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/scorecard">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Where are you actually losing command?</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          A man can look functional from the outside and still know something is
          slipping underneath.
        </p>
        <p>Pressure becomes irritability.</p>
        <p>Responsibility becomes resentment.</p>
        <p>Silence becomes withdrawal.</p>
        <p>
          Stress starts affecting how you lead, communicate, father, love, and
          carry yourself.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Freeze-to-Command Scorecard is a short private assessment designed
          to help you see where that breakdown may be happening—and where the
          greatest pressure points are.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-block">
        <PrimaryButton href={assessmentPath}>Begin the Scorecard</PrimaryButton>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container section-grid section-grid--two">
      <SectionHeader heading="What emotional freeze can look like" />
      <div class="reading">
        <p>
          You may still be handling your responsibilities while noticing that:
        </p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li>you shut down when conversations become emotionally charged;</li>
          <li>small pressures trigger disproportionate irritation;</li>
          <li>
            you withdraw instead of saying what actually needs to be said;
          </li>
          <li>
            responsibility increasingly feels like weight rather than purpose;
          </li>
          <li>
            you feel less patient with your partner, children, or the people
            depending on you;
          </li>
          <li>
            you know something is wrong, but you cannot clearly identify the
            pattern.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>The problem is not simply that you are stressed.</p>
        <p>The question is what happens to you under that stress.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container section-grid section-grid--two">
      <SectionHeader heading="What the Scorecard will help you identify" />
      <div class="reading">
        <p>The assessment is designed to give you a clearer picture of:</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li>where you are currently losing emotional command;</li>
          <li>which pressure points are affecting you most;</li>
          <li>
            how those patterns may be showing up in your relationships,
            leadership, fatherhood, and decision-making;
          </li>
          <li>
            whether the issue appears situational or part of a deeper recurring
            pattern.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>This is not a personality test or a diagnosis.</p>
        <p>It is a way to make the pattern more visible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container section-grid section-grid--two">
      <SectionHeader heading="What happens next" />
      <div class="reading">
        <p>Complete the assessment as accurately as you can.</p>
        <p>You will receive your results after submitting it.</p>
        <p>
          I also review submissions personally where I believe deeper feedback
          may be useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          If I believe your situation warrants a closer look, I may invite you
          to a private Sovereign Diagnostic to examine what is happening, what
          is driving it, and what may need to change.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reading">
        <div class="cta-block">
          <PrimaryButton href={assessmentPath}
            >Take the Freeze-to-Command Scorecard</PrimaryButton
          >
        </div>
        <p class="privacy-note">
          Your responses are treated as private and are used to evaluate your
          current situation and determine what next step, if any, may be
          appropriate.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cta-block {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .points {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .privacy-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
  }

  .final-cta {
    background: var(--color-soft);
  }
</style>
